-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §44 ליקויי למידה: the whole budget meant
-- for paying teaching employees for work with pupils with learning
-- disabilities, under the wages commissioner's letter of 5.1.2009, went to
-- fund other components this agreement agrees; under the reform that work
-- is done in the individual hours; and from תשע"ב the payment under the
-- letter stops for every teaching employee.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`

§ `44 ליקויי למידה`

-- (א): a clarification: the budget meant for the pay of teaching employees
-- for work with pupils with learning disabilities, as the wages
-- commissioner's letter to the Ministry's director-general of 5.1.2009
-- sets it out ("מכתב הממונה על השכר"), was moved to fund other salary
-- components this agreement agrees. It records where the money went; what
-- it asks of anyone is (ב) and (ג).
@ref akn:art_44__para_a
`the learning-disabilities budget went to other components of the Oz agreement` MEANS TRUE

`why the wages commissioner's letter of 5.1.2009 is not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "מכתב הממונה על השכר והסכמי עבודה במשרד האוצר אל מנכ\"לית משרד החינוך מיום 5.1.2009, תגמול עובדי הוראה עבור עבודה עם תלמידים ליקויי למידה"

-- (ב): under the reform, the work with pupils with learning disabilities
-- the letter details is done within the individual hours (§9(ו)(2)). A
-- teaching employee off the reform is not spoken of.
@ref akn:art_44__para_b
GIVEN e IS AN `extent of the Oz reform`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the learning-disabilities work is done in the individual hours` e IF
    NOT e EQUALS `off the Oz reform`

-- (ג): from the school year תשע"ב (convention dates.school-year) the
-- payment under the letter stops, for every teaching employee, on the
-- reform's terms or not. Before it, what the letter paid is the letter's.
@ref akn:art_44__para_c
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the letter's learning-disabilities payment has stopped in` y IF
    y AT LEAST `the school year 5772`

§§ `44 -- illustrations`

#ASSERT `the learning-disabilities work is done in the individual hours` `the Oz reform in part`
#ASSERT NOT `the learning-disabilities work is done in the individual hours` `off the Oz reform`
#ASSERT `the letter's learning-disabilities payment has stopped in` `the school year 5772`
#ASSERT NOT `the letter's learning-disabilities payment has stopped in` 2010
